      "title": "S. Melnik et al., Dremel: Interactive Analysis of Web-Scale Datasets, Proceedings of the VLDB Endowment 3(1):330-339, 2010",
      "url": "https://research.google/pubs/dremel-interactive-analysis-of-web-scale-datasets-2/",
