      "claim": "Double precision numbers carry a 53 bit significand, so every integer up to two to the fifty-third is representable exactly and beyond that the spacing between representable values grows: at two to the fifty-third it is 2. Two to the fifty-third is 9007199254740992, so that value and the integer above it both round to the same double.",
